{
  "rule": "Only assign the charge of 故意伤害 when the defendant’s intentional act results in actual bodily injury (e.g., bruises, cuts, fractures) that meets the statutory injury threshold; if no injury or only a superficial impact without medical evidence of harm occurred, charge only 故意毁坏财物.",
  "keywords": [
    "未造成伤害",
    "仅打了一下",
    "无医疗鉴定",
    "仅损坏财物",
    "未致人受伤"
  ]
}
